<urn:atm:triage:finding/ATM-QA-AW5R1-002>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "ATM-QA-AW5R1-002" ;
  triage:title "CLI parity test never runs in CI: test_cli_parity.py is pytest gated on ATM_CLI_PARITY_FIXTURE and ci.yml has no pytest job or fixture for it" ;
  triage:description "qa-pr1184-r1 req-qa (quality-mgr msg 01M1QXMHJAHK8JXHGQRAM606ZG, confirmed): crates/atm-graft-python/tests/test_cli_parity.py is gated on the ATM_CLI_PARITY_FIXTURE env var; .github/workflows/ci.yml has no reference to that var or to pytest, and the only Python matrix job runs unittest discover on crates/hermes-atm/tests. AC1/AC6 are therefore unverified by any actual run. Fix: run the parity test in CI with a real fixture (generate it in-job from the CLI, or commit a fixture) so it executes on every PR; keep the env-gated skip only for local runs without the fixture. CLOSURE (2026-09-05T05:30:00Z): r2 verified fixed: req-qa/arch-qa/rust-qa-agent all confirm resolved at b7fbf54e64 (quality-mgr independently spot-checked source)." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-aw" ;
